sequenceDiagram
  actor Teacher
  participant Web as Teacher Portal
  participant API as Callable Function
  participant DB as Firestore Canonical
  participant W as Recompute Worker
  participant UI as Student My DU
  Teacher->>Web: mark attendance / save grade draft
  Web->>API: command + requestId + Firebase auth
  API->>API: role, assignment, enrollment and revision guards
  API->>DB: transaction: canonical draft + audit + receipt
  DB-->>Web: committed draft (not yet visible to student)
  Teacher->>Web: publish
  Web->>API: publish command
  API->>DB: publish barrier + dirty summary job
  DB-->>W: eventual trigger/retry
  W->>DB: read latest published canonical records
  W->>W: computeRisk(policy snapshot)
  W->>DB: update owner-only materialized views (CAS)
  DB-->>UI: read-only owner snapshot update
